---
---
<footer class="bg-green-900 text-white mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid md:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="p-8 md:p-16 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
            <img src="/images/logo-aman.png" alt="Logo" class="h-12 w-auto brightness-0 invert" />
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">AMAN <span class="text-green-400">Mentawai</span></h2>
        </div>
        <p class="text-green-100/70 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
          Berjuang bersama masyarakat adat Mentawai untuk kedaulatan, kemandirian, dan martabat budaya di Kabupaten Kepulauan Mentawai.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="text-xl"></span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-green-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Sekretariat</h4>
            <p class="text-green-50 text-sm">Jalan Raya Tuapejat Km. 1, Sipora Utara, Kab. Kep. Mentawai, Sumatera Barat 25700</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="text-xl"></span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-green-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Email</h4>
            <p class="text-green-50 text-sm">pd.mentawai@aman.or.id</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="text-xl"></span>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-green-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider">Facebook</h4>
            <p class="text-green-50 text-sm">RUMAH AMAN Daerah Kepulauan Mentawai</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="h-[400px] md:h-auto min-h-[300px] relative">
      <img 
        src="/images/peta.jpg" 
        alt="Peta Lokasi" 
        class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover opacity-60 hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-green-900 via-transparent to-transparent md:block hidden"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="border-t border-white/10 py-6 text-center text-sm text-green-100/30">
    &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} AMAN Mentawai. Seluruh Hak Cipta Dilindungi.
  </div>
</footer>